{
 "_readme": [
  "Wave 11 (lane 11B) -- THE shared test vectors for the formula language.",
  "Read by BOTH tests/test_formula_engine.py (the server engine) and",
  "app/src/pages/journal-2-0/lib/formula/formulaEngine.vectors.test.js (the client engine).",
  "Every expected value was written by hand from the grammar's rules, never recorded",
  "from either engine. `values` are keyed by property id: a number is a value, null is",
  "an empty property, anything else is not a number, and an absent key is a property",
  "that does not exist. `names` (lowercased name -> id, null = shared by two) means the",
  "expression is in the member's {Name} form and is converted to ids first. `gen` builds",
  "the expression as each [text, count] repeated count times, joined."
 ],
 "limits": {
  "maxLength": 2000,
  "maxTokens": 500,
  "maxDepth": 32,
  "maxNumberChars": 32,
  "maxRoundPlaces": 10
 },
